function GameDirectory({teams,season,gameType}:{teams:Row[];season:number;gameType:string}){const [team,setTeam]=useState(''),[day,setDay]=useState(''),[offset,setOffset]=useState(0),[revision,setRevision]=useState(0);useEffect(()=>setOffset(0),[season,gameType]);const state=useData('/games?'+params({team_id:team,start_date:day||`${season}-01-01`,end_date:day||`${season}-12-31`,offset,limit:50}),revision);return <section className="panel"><div className="section-head"><div><h2>Imported games</h2><span>{state.data?.total??'…'} games stored in {season} · all competitions</span></div><button className="secondary" onClick={()=>setRevision(x=>x+1)}>Refresh</button></div><div className="filters"><label>Team<select aria-label="Filter team" value={team} onChange={e=>{setTeam(e.target.value);setOffset(0);}}><option value="">All teams</option>{teams.map(t=><option key={t.id} value={t.id}>{t.name}</option>)}</select></label><label>Date<input aria-label="Filter date" type="date" value={day} onChange={e=>{setDay(e.target.value);setOffset(0);}}/></label><button className="text-button" onClick={()=>{setTeam('');setDay('');setOffset(0);}}>Clear filters</button></div><Status state={state} onRetry={()=>setRevision(x=>x+1)}/>{state.data&&<><GamesTable games={state.data.items} teams={teams}/><Pager offset={offset} total={state.data.total} onChange={setOffset}/><Source data={null}>Local imported games. Team pages also show the complete MLB schedule while imports continue.</Source></>}</section>;}
function App(){const deployment=useData('/deployment');const route=useRoute();const [season,setSeason]=useSaved('season',Number(new URLSearchParams(location.hash.split('?')[1]).get('season'))||2026),[gameType,setGameType]=useSaved('gameType',new URLSearchParams(location.hash.split('?')[1]).get('game_type')||'R'),[revision,setRevision]=useState(0);useEffect(()=>{const query=new URLSearchParams(location.hash.split('?')[1]);const year=Number(query.get('season'));if(year>=2020&&year<=2026)setSeason(year);const competition=query.get('game_type');if(competition&&gameTypes[competition])setGameType(competition);},[]);const directory=useData('/teams');const summary=useData('/summary',revision);const backfill=useData('/backfill',revision);useEffect(()=>{const t=setInterval(()=>setRevision(x=>x+1),15000);return()=>clearInterval(t);},[]);const teams:Row[]=directory.data||[];const parts=route.split('/').filter(Boolean),section=parts[0]||'teams',id=Number(parts[1]);const title=section==='compare'?'Compare the players.':section==='changes'?'See what changed.':section==='favorites'?'Your baseball dashboard.':section==='leaderboards'?'Find the league leaders.':section==='imports'?'Bring the game in.':section==='players'?'Know the player.':section==='teams'?'Inside every clubhouse.':'Explore the game.';return <div className="shell"><aside><a className="brand" href="#/teams">◆ <span>diamond<small>BASEBALL DATA EXPLORER</small></span></a><div className="nav-label">WORKSPACE</div><nav>{[['teams','⚑','Teams'],['players','♙','Players'],['leaderboards','↗','Leaderboards'],['games','◫','Games'],['compare','⇄','Compare'],['changes','Δ','Year changes'],['favorites','☆','Favorites'],['imports','↧','Imports']].map(([path,icon,label])=><button key={path} className={section===path?'active':''} onClick={()=>go('/'+path)}><span>{icon}</span>{label}</button>)}</nav><div className="aside-bottom"><span className="dot"/> YOUR LOCAL DATABASE<p>Official context. Every game in detail.</p></div></aside><main><a className="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a>{deployment.data?.read_only&&<section className="coverage" role="note"><strong>Read-only portfolio demo</strong><span>Source snapshots may be historical. Imports and background refresh are disabled.</span></section>}<header id="main-content" tabIndex={-1}><div><div className="eyebrow">THE DIAMOND WORKSPACE</div><h1>{title}</h1><p>Standings, rosters, and the stories behind the numbers.</p></div><button className="primary" onClick={()=>go('/imports')}>↧ Import MLB data</button></header><Freshness season={season} gameType={gameType}/>{backfill.data&&backfill.data.status!=='not_started'&&<section className="coverage backfill-progress" aria-label="Historical backfill progress"><strong>{backfill.data.status==='completed'?'Backfill complete':'Historical backfill: '+backfill.data.status}</strong><span>{backfill.data.start_date} to {backfill.data.end_date} · {backfill.data.coverage?.final_complete?.toLocaleString()} / {backfill.data.coverage?.final_expected?.toLocaleString()} final games audited · {backfill.data.summary_requests_complete?.toLocaleString()} player summaries · {backfill.data.statcast_rows?.toLocaleString()} Statcast rows{backfill.data.active?.month&&<> · Current: {backfill.data.active.month} ({backfill.data.active_run?.processed_games} / {backfill.data.active_run?.total_games} games)</>}</span></section>}{section!=='imports'&&<div className="global-filters"><label>Season<select aria-label="Season" value={season} onChange={e=>setSeason(Number(e.target.value))}>{[2026,2025,2024,2023,2022,2021,2020].map(y=><option key={y}>{y}</option>)}</select></label><label>Competition<select aria-label="Competition" value={gameType} onChange={e=>setGameType(e.target.value)}>{Object.entries(gameTypes).map(([key,label])=><option key={key} value={key}>{String(label)}</option>)}</select></label><span>Season stats and rankings use official MLB totals.<br/>Detailed logs grow as imports finish.</span></div>}{!id&&!['compare','changes','favorites'].includes(section)&&<section className="metrics">{[['Teams',summary.data?.teams],['Players',summary.data?.players],['Games',summary.data?.games],['Stat lines',(summary.data?.player_game_batting||0)+(summary.data?.player_game_pitching||0)]].map(([label,value])=><div key={label}><span>{label}</span><strong>{Number(value||0).toLocaleString()}</strong><small>IN YOUR DATABASE · ALL YEARS</small></div>)}</section>}{section==='compare'?<Comparison season={season} gameType={gameType}/>:section==='changes'?<Changes season={season} gameType={gameType}/>:section==='favorites'?<Favorites season={season} gameType={gameType}/>:section==='teams'?(id?<TeamPage key={id} id={id} season={season} gameType={gameType} teams={teams}/>:<Standings season={season}/>):section==='players'?(id?<PlayerPage key={id} id={id} season={season} gameType={gameType} teams={teams}/>:<PlayerList season={season} gameType={gameType} leaderboard={false} teams={teams}/>):section==='leaderboards'?<PlayerList key="leaders" season={season} gameType={gameType} leaderboard teams={teams}/>:section==='imports'?<Imports/>:id?<GamePage id={id} teams={teams}/>:<GameDirectory teams={teams} season={season} gameType={gameType}/>}<footer>MLB Stats API · Official summaries are separate from imported game logs. Contract analysis uses separately imported, source-tracked data.</footer></main></div>;}

createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(<App/>);
